<title>POLAND: Barings to lead Hetman convertible bonds.</title>
<headline>Barings to lead Hetman convertible bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish National Investment Fund Hetman said on Monday it the picked Barings Brothers Ltd unit of ING Groep to prepare and lead an issue of its convertible bonds.</p>
<p>It said all details of the issue would be given to the fund's shareholders a week before the general shareholders meeting on August 21.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
